[[1,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Place the vehicle on a ramp and raise it.</p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Integrated air temperature sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890638\">K43</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo the bolt.</p><p>3. Remove the sensor.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035367.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the sensor is not damaged.</p><p>1. Position the sensor.</p><p>2. Tighten the bolt.</p><p>3. Check the distance between the senor and the flywheel teeth (gap).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001286.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Measurement</p></th><th></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Distance between sensor and phonic wheel (mm)</p></td><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>0.5 - 1.5</p></td></tr></table></div><p>4. Connect the electrical connection.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035368.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]]